# 1.4.13: Setup's MIDI page (GLO, again): each voice's channel (par235..237), Notes in (par238: Scale, Play). Voice 1
# on channel 5: its knobs' CC go out on it (its INDEX, CC 20); with Play, a note in on channel 5 plays voice 1 (out
